{"suttaId":"tha-ap440","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[725,760],"vripara":"60"},"segments":{"tha-ap440:0.3":"Harītakadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap440:1.1":"“Harītakaṃ āmalakaṃ, ambajambuvibhītakaṃ;","tha-ap440:1.3":"Kolaṃ bhallātakaṃ billaṃ, sayameva harāmahaṃ.","tha-ap440:2.1":"“Disvāna pabbhāragataṃ, jhāyiṃ jhānarataṃ muniṃ;","tha-ap440:2.3":"Ābādhena āpīḷentaṃ, adutīyaṃ mahāmuniṃ.","tha-ap440:3.1":"“Harītakaṃ gahetvāna, sayambhussa adāsahaṃ;","tha-ap440:3.3":"Khādamattamhi bhesajje, byādhi passambhi [passaddhi (ka.)] tāvade.","tha-ap440:4.1":"“Pahīnadaratho buddho, anumodamakāsi me;","tha-ap440:4.3":"‘Bhesajjadāneniminā, byādhivūpasamena ca.","tha-ap440:5.1":"“‘Devabhūto manusso vā, jāto vā aññajātiyā;","tha-ap440:5.3":"Sabbattha sukhito hotu, mā ca te byādhimāgamā’.","tha-ap440:6.1":"“Idaṃ vatvāna sambuddho, sayambhū aparājito;","tha-ap440:6.3":"Nabhaṃ abbhuggamī dhīro, haṃsarājāva ambare.","tha-ap440:7.1":"“Yato harītakaṃ dinnaṃ, sayambhussa mahesino;","tha-ap440:7.3":"Imaṃ jātiṃ upādāya, byādhi me nupapajjatha.","tha-ap440:8.1":"“Ayaṃ pacchimako mayhaṃ, carimo vattate bhavo;","tha-ap440:8.3":"Tisso vijjā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap440:9.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, bhesajjamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap440:9.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, bhesajjassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap440:10.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap440:11.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap440:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap440:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā harītakadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap440:14.1":"Harītakadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
